  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Its swinging arm is edged with chipped black obsidian.</p><p>As an action, you can set this trap in an unoccupied space within reach. When a creature enters that space, the trap goes off: the creature that triggers it must succeed on a [[/save ability=dex dc=13 format=long]] or it takes [[/damage 3d6 type=slashing]] damage. The trap is then spent. A creature that spots it can disarm it with a [[/check ability=dex dc=13 format=long]].</p>",
